{"seq":2,"slug":"brand-qualification-unbind","title":"品牌、资质与账户解绑与责任保留期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/data-release-lifecycle/brand-qualification-unbind","wordCount":3825,"readingTime":16,"html":"<h1 id=\"品牌-资质与账户解绑与责任保留期\">品牌、资质与账户解绑与责任保留期</h1><p>关店的最后一步是&quot;解绑&quot;——把商家与它挂在平台上的各种关系逐一拆开：品牌授权、类目资质、支付账户、企业主体绑定、店铺域名。这一步看起来只是清理配置，实际上是一次<strong>风险敞口的重新分配</strong>：每解绑一项，商家的责任约束就少一层，而其中有些约束恰恰是平台在出现纠纷时唯一的抓手。</p>\n<p>因此解绑的核心问题不是&quot;怎么做&quot;，而是&quot;<strong>什么顺序</strong>&quot;。顺序错了会在最需要证据的时候把证据链断掉——一个典型场景是平台先解绑了支付账户，两周后收到一批拒付，此时既无法从该账户扣款，也很难证明扣款权的存在。本文给出解绑的分层模型与顺序规则，并把&quot;责任保留期&quot;作为一个显式的、有形期限的机制（而不是一句&quot;保留追索权&quot;的声明）。数据删除与留存期表见 <a href=\"data-export-delete-retention\">商家数据导出/删除与法定留存</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"解绑的五个对象与三种性质\">解绑的五个对象与三种性质</h3><p>商家在平台上挂载的关系有五类，它们的解绑难度与风险各不相同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>关系性质</th>\n<th>解绑后平台失去什么</th>\n<th>可恢复性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支付账户</td>\n<td>资金通道</td>\n<td>扣款与打款能力</td>\n<td>需商家重新验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业主体绑定</td>\n<td>法律身份</td>\n<td>追索对象的映射</td>\n<td>需重新核验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌授权</td>\n<td>知识产权授权</td>\n<td>商品合法性的证明</td>\n<td>依赖品牌方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目资质</td>\n<td>经营许可</td>\n<td>继续经营的合规基础</td>\n<td>补证即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>店铺域名/标识</td>\n<td>标识资源</td>\n<td>流量入口与品牌资产</td>\n<td>可释放或保留</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类性质按&quot;解绑是否可逆&quot;划分，这个划分直接决定处理顺序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>处理时机</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可逆</td>\n<td>类目资质、店铺标识</td>\n<td>最早/最晚两端</td>\n<td>成本低或仍有举证价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需重新核验</td>\n<td>支付账户、企业主体</td>\n<td>责任落地后</td>\n<td>解绑即一次新准入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖第三方</td>\n<td>品牌授权</td>\n<td>尽早启动</td>\n<td>平台无法单方恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>据此得到的顺序是：依赖第三方意志的先处理（恢复成本最高），平台自有的标识资源最后释放（期间仍有举证价值——买家凭店铺标识识别&quot;我买的是哪家店&quot;）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么解绑必须有顺序而不是并行\">为什么解绑必须有顺序而不是并行</h3><p>一个直觉上更高效的做法是并行解绑全部五类。它的问题在于解绑动作之间存在<strong>隐式的依赖</strong>：支付账户是扣款与赔付的执行通道，企业主体绑定是追索的法律映射，二者构成了平台的资金回收能力。如果这两项在任何未决争议之前被解绑，平台就失去了执行能力。</p>\n<p>因此正确的结构是按&quot;<strong>责任是否已经完全落地</strong>&quot;分期解绑，而不是按对象类型一次性处理：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[退出生效] --&gt; B[一期: 释放可逆项&lt;br/&gt;类目资质 / 营销能力]&#10;  B --&gt; C[二期: 处理依赖第三方的项&lt;br/&gt;品牌授权协商 / 移交]&#10;  C --&gt; D[责任保留期内&lt;br/&gt;支付账户与企业主体绑定保留]&#10;  D --&gt; E{责任保留期届满?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[发生新争议&lt;br/&gt;保留期按规则延长]&#10;  F --&gt; D&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[三期: 解绑支付账户&lt;br/&gt;解绑企业主体绑定]&#10;  G --&gt; H[释放店铺标识&lt;br/&gt;或转为历史归档标识]&#10;  H --&gt; I[进入数据留存期&lt;br/&gt;见数据导出/删除篇]\">graph TD\n  A[退出生效] --&gt; B[一期: 释放可逆项&lt;br/&gt;类目资质 / 营销能力]\n  B --&gt; C[二期: 处理依赖第三方的项&lt;br/&gt;品牌授权协商 / 移交]\n  C --&gt; D[责任保留期内&lt;br/&gt;支付账户与企业主体绑定保留]\n  D --&gt; E{责任保留期届满?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[发生新争议&lt;br/&gt;保留期按规则延长]\n  F --&gt; D\n  E --&gt;|是| G[三期: 解绑支付账户&lt;br/&gt;解绑企业主体绑定]\n  G --&gt; H[释放店铺标识&lt;br/&gt;或转为历史归档标识]\n  H --&gt; I[进入数据留存期&lt;br/&gt;见数据导出/删除篇]</pre><p>图中有一个关键分支：<strong>发生新争议时保留期延长</strong>。这使&quot;责任保留期&quot;成为一个动态量而非固定值。它的合理性在于：保留期存在的目的是确保有抓手应对未决与潜在的争议，如果期间真的发生了争议，那么让它延长正是这个机制的工作原理。三个阶段各自锁住的资源如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>起点</th>\n<th>可释放</th>\n<th>必须保留</th>\n<th>生效条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一期</td>\n<td>退出生效</td>\n<td>类目资质、营销能力、场景资源</td>\n<td>全部资金与主体关系</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二期</td>\n<td>一期完成</td>\n<td>品牌授权、商品归属</td>\n<td>支付账户、主体绑定</td>\n<td>品牌方确认或按规则移交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三期</td>\n<td>保留期届满</td>\n<td>支付账户、店铺标识</td>\n<td>主体绑定（转历史）</td>\n<td>无未结债权且无未决争议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了为什么不能并行：一期的动作不涉及任何资金能力，可以立即执行；二期的品牌授权需要第三方参与，耗时不可控，但同样不影响资金能力；只有三期才触及平台的执行能力，因此它必须等到所有可能产生资金诉求的窗口关闭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"责任保留期的定义与计算\">责任保留期的定义与计算</h2><h3 id=\"保留期由三个窗口的最大值决定\">保留期由三个窗口的最大值决定</h3><p>责任保留期不是拍出来的数字，它应当覆盖三个可能产生诉求的时间窗口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>窗口</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拒付窗口</td>\n<td>卡组织允许发起拒付的期限</td>\n<td>通常至 120 天，部分类型更长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>售后与质保窗口</td>\n<td>消费者法定救济期</td>\n<td>自交付起 1–2 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合同违约追诉期</td>\n<td>民事请求权的诉讼时效</td>\n<td>按法域，通常 2–6 年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行的量级有明确的成文依据：欧盟《关于货物销售合同某些方面的指令》（Directive (EU) 2019/771）第 10 条规定卖方对交付后<strong>两年内</strong>显现的不符合负责（成员国可规定更长），第 11 条规定交付后<strong>一年内</strong>显现的缺陷推定为交付时即已存在（成员国可延长至两年）（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32019L0771\">Directive (EU) 2019/771</a>）。也就是说，承载该窗口的<strong>资质与账户能力</strong>至少要被保留到最后一笔订单交付后两年。</p>\n<p>取三者最大值会得到一个很长的保留期（因为诉讼时效最长），这会让解绑遥遥无期。因此实践中的做法是<strong>分层保留而非全量保留</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>chargeback</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>warranty</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>minimal</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>limitation</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{full}} = \\max(W_{\\text{chargeback}}, W_{\\text{warranty}}), \\qquad R_{\\text{minimal}} = T_{\\text{limitation}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chargeback</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warranty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">minimal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">limitation</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{full}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 期间，支付账户与企业主体绑定全部保留；在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{full}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之后但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>minimal</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{minimal}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">minimal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之前，账户能力已解绑，但<strong>企业主体绑定与合同关系记录保留</strong>——因为追诉只需要能确定被告，不需要能扣款。</p>\n<p>这个分层解决了一个真实的两难：保留全部能力多年会让平台积累大量&quot;僵尸账户&quot;增加运维与合规负担，而全部解绑会让长时效的违约追诉无从落地。<strong>把&quot;能扣钱&quot;与&quot;能起诉&quot;分开保留</strong>，是这两者之间唯一的可行折中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保留期的记录方式\">保留期的记录方式</h3><p>保留期必须在数据上显式存在，否则它会在人员更替与系统迁移中消失：</p>\n<p>保留期必须在数据上显式存在，否则它会在人员更替与系统迁移中消失：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE merchant_liability_retention (&#10;  retention_id      BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  legal_entity_id   BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  closure_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  full_retention_end DATE       NOT NULL,   -- 账户能力保留至此&#10;  minimal_retention_end DATE    NOT NULL,   -- 主体关系记录保留至此&#10;  extended_by       VARCHAR(64),            -- 触发延长的争议引用&#10;  extension_count   SMALLINT    NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  state             VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- FULL | MINIMAL | RELEASED&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_window CHECK (minimal_retention_end &gt;= full_retention_end),&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_state CHECK (state IN (&#39;FULL&#39;,&#39;MINIMAL&#39;,&#39;RELEASED&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merchant_liability_retention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retention_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closure_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  full_retention_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 账户能力保留至此</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minimal_retention_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主体关系记录保留至此</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  extended_by       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 触发延长的争议引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  extension_count   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- FULL | MINIMAL | RELEASED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (minimal_retention_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> full_retention_end),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FULL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MINIMAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>extension_count</code> 是识别<strong>恶意延长</strong>的探针：若某主体的保留期被反复延长，通常意味着有持续的、新发生的争议。这本身就是该主体再次申请入驻时的重要风险信号，应被 <a href=\"reactivation-readmission-rule\">关店复活/再入驻限制与退出度量</a> 采纳。<code>ck_window</code> 保证两段保留期不会倒置。</p>\n<p>两段保留期各自锁住的资源不同，这个分工是分层的全部意义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>支付账户可用</th>\n<th>主体绑定保留</th>\n<th>主要目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FULL</td>\n<td>保留期内</td>\n<td>冻结但可扣款</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>执行拒付扣款与赔付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MINIMAL</td>\n<td>能力已释放</td>\n<td>已解绑</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>支持长时效的违约追诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RELEASED</td>\n<td>全部释放</td>\n<td>已解绑</td>\n<td>否（转历史归档）</td>\n<td>生命周期终结</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 MINIMAL 阶段&quot;已解绑但保留主体绑定&quot;这一组合并不矛盾：它表示平台<strong>不能再从该商家扣钱，但仍然知道它是谁</strong>。这个区分让平台可以在诉讼时效内正常起诉一个已经离开的商家，而无需为此长期冻结其账户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品牌授权与资质的解绑\">品牌授权与资质的解绑</h2><h3 id=\"品牌授权的解绑需要品牌方参与\">品牌授权的解绑需要品牌方参与</h3><p>品牌授权与类目资质的解绑难度差异很大：类目资质是平台授予的，平台可以单方撤销；品牌授权是<strong>品牌方与商家之间的法律关系</strong>，平台只是记录者。这个区别决定了平台在品牌授权解绑中的角色是<strong>验证与登记</strong>，而不是决定。</p>\n<p>因此品牌授权的&quot;解绑&quot;实际包含两个必须分开的动作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>平台侧登记解除</strong>：撤销该商家在平台内使用该品牌标识的权限，停止以其名义发布商品；</li>\n<li><strong>存量的处理</strong>：已发布商品的处置（下架、转移给新授权方、或按平台规则清退库存）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第二项最容易出问题。如果只做第一项，已发布的商品会处于一个悬空状态——商品页仍在、品牌标识仍在、但授权已解除，这在知识产权投诉中会直接导致平台被认定为未采取必要措施。因此<strong>授权解绑必须与商品状态变更原子地发生</strong>，不能先解绑、后择期清理商品。有两种处置方式的选择依据如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置方式</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>数据动作</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下架清退</td>\n<td>无新授权方接手</td>\n<td>商品转 DELISTED</td>\n<td>库存与已下单订单的处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转移给新授权方</td>\n<td>品牌方指定了继任商家</td>\n<td>商品归属改写 + 保留历史</td>\n<td>归属改写需可审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按平台规则清退</td>\n<td>品牌方未回应</td>\n<td>到期自动下架</td>\n<td>品牌方事后主张</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种方式中，归属改写必须留下完整的审计记录：<strong>同一商品在两个商家之间转移，是知识产权争议中最常被质疑的操作</strong>。保留历史归属（而不是覆盖）是唯一的自证方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"资质解绑与-是否可复活-的耦合\">资质解绑与&quot;是否可复活&quot;的耦合</h3><p>类目资质的解绑与退出类型相关，而不同退出类型在数据上必须可区分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退出类型</th>\n<th><code>revocation_reason</code></th>\n<th>是否保留可恢复性</th>\n<th>证明材料用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主动关店</td>\n<td><code>VOLUNTARY</code></td>\n<td>是（补证即恢复）</td>\n<td>无风险含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资质失效</td>\n<td><code>EXPIRED</code></td>\n<td>是（补齐有效期）</td>\n<td>无风险含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>违约清退</td>\n<td><code>REVOKED_FOR_BREACH</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>其它平台/监管查询时成为事实</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>缺少这个区分会让两类完全不同的商家在数据上看起来一样，从而在再入驻审核时无法区分——一个因为执照过期而暂时失效的商家与一个因售假被吊销资质的商家，前者应当无摩擦恢复，后者应当进入 <a href=\"reactivation-readmission-rule\">关店复活/再入驻限制与退出度量</a> 中的观察期或拒绝档。</p>\n<h3 id=\"企业主体绑定的不可解绑性\">企业主体绑定的不可解绑性</h3><p>有一个需要明确的反直觉结论：<strong>企业主体绑定在多数场景下不应被真正解绑，只能被标记为失效</strong>。原因是它承载的是&quot;平台内这一系列行为归属于哪个法律主体&quot;这一事实，而这个事实不会因为业务关系终止而变成假的。删除这个映射会让历史交易、历史纠纷、历史赔付都失去归属对象。</p>\n<p>因此正确的操作是<strong>状态变更而非关系删除</strong>，三种状态的语义边界需要明确：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>是否可重新激活</th>\n<th>历史归属是否保留</th>\n<th>何时转入</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ACTIVE</td>\n<td>关系存续</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>核验通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INACTIVE</td>\n<td>业务关系终止，主体仍存在</td>\n<td>是（走复活流程）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>退出生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DISSOLVED</td>\n<td>法律主体已消灭</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（仅用于归属）</td>\n<td>工商注销确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>DISSOLVED</code> 这一档的存在意义在于：主体消灭是一个<strong>可从外部核实的事实</strong>（工商登记、破产终结裁定），把它作为独立状态而不是直接删除，使平台能在若干年后仍然回答&quot;这笔十年前的交易属于哪个已不存在的法人&quot;。这也是为什么 <a href=\"data-export-delete-retention\">商家数据导出/删除与法定留存</a> 中凭证表要以 <code>legal_entity_id</code> 而非商家账户为主键——两者的生命周期必须解耦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解绑的执行控制\">解绑的执行控制</h2><h3 id=\"解绑动作的前置校验\">解绑动作的前置校验</h3><p>解绑是一个具有外部效果的写操作，因此每一个解绑动作都应当有前置校验，并且校验必须与执行在同一事务或同一条件更新内完成，避免读-改-写竞态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE merchant_binding b&#10;   SET state = &#39;RELEASED&#39;, released_at = now()&#10; WHERE b.binding_id = $1&#10;   AND b.state = &#39;INACTIVE&#39;&#10;   AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;     SELECT 1 FROM merchant_liability_retention r&#10;      WHERE r.legal_entity_id = b.legal_entity_id&#10;        AND r.state = &#39;FULL&#39;&#10;        AND r.full_retention_end &gt; now()&#10;   )&#10;   AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;     SELECT 1 FROM platform_advance_claim c&#10;      JOIN merchant_closure_event e ON e.closure_id = c.closure_id&#10;     WHERE e.merchant_id = b.merchant_id&#10;       AND c.recovery_state IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;FILED&#39;)&#10;   );\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_binding b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, released_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">binding_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'INACTIVE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_liability_retention r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">legal_entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">legal_entity_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FULL'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">full_retention_end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> platform_advance_claim c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merchant_closure_event e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closure_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closure_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">merchant_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">merchant_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recovery_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   );</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条语句里两个 <code>NOT EXISTS</code> 就是解绑的两道闸门：<strong>责任保留期未届满不解绑</strong>、<strong>存在未回收的代垫债权不解绑</strong>。把它们写成标签条件而不是应用层的 if，是因为解绑可能由多种入口触发（定时任务、人工后台、商家自助），只有在存储层统一拦截才能保证没有绕过路径。这也是&quot;不可掩盖退出码&quot;那条纪律在数据层的对应做法——<strong>判定与执行必须在同一条语句里</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"解绑的不可逆性与审计\">解绑的不可逆性与审计</h3><p>解绑动作应该是<strong>幂等且只追加</strong>的：一次解绑产生一条不可变的记录，恢复需要产生新的记录而不是改回原状态。这样做的好处是任何时刻都能回答&quot;这个绑定在什么时间点被解绑过几次&quot;，这对识别&quot;解绑后被重新绑定&quot;这一异常模式很重要——<strong>反复解绑重绑往往是规避风控限制的手法</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;binding_event&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;binding_id&quot;: 77412,&#10;    &quot;binding_type&quot;: &quot;BRAND_AUTHORIZATION&quot;,&#10;    &quot;action&quot;: &quot;RELEASE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;at&quot;: &quot;2026-11-02T09:14:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;actor&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;SYSTEM&quot;, &quot;job&quot;: &quot;release_expired_retention&quot; },&#10;    &quot;gate_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;full_retention_end&quot;: &quot;2026-10-30&quot;,&#10;      &quot;open_advance_claims&quot;: 0,&#10;      &quot;state_at_action&quot;: &quot;INACTIVE&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;reversible&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;reversal_requires&quot;: &quot;BRAND_OWNER_REAUTHORIZATION&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"binding_event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"binding_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77412</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"binding_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BRAND_AUTHORIZATION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RELEASE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-02T09:14:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"actor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SYSTEM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"job\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"release_expired_retention\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"gate_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"full_retention_end\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"open_advance_claims\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"state_at_action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INACTIVE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reversible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reversal_requires\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BRAND_OWNER_REAUTHORIZATION\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>gate_snapshot</code> 是这里的关键设计：它把解绑<strong>当时</strong>的判定依据固化下来。多年后被问&quot;为什么在还有未结争议时解绑了&quot;，凭这条快照就能证明当时确实没有未结争议；反之，如果快照显示有未结事项而仍然解绑，那就是一次有据可查的流程违规。<strong>没有快照的解绑记录在争议中等于没有记录</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>解绑是一次<strong>风险敞口的重新分配</strong>，核心不是&quot;怎么做&quot;而是&quot;什么顺序&quot;；五类对象按&quot;解绑是否可逆&quot;分三档，依赖第三方意志的（品牌授权）先处理，平台自有的标识资源最后释放。</li>\n<li>不应并行解绑：支付账户与企业主体绑定构成平台的资金回收与法律追索能力，必须在责任落地后才释放。</li>\n<li>责任保留期由拒付窗口、售后与质保窗口、合同违约追诉期三者中取最大，并<strong>分层保留</strong>——先用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>chargeback</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>warranty</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(W_{\\text{chargeback}}, W_{\\text{warranty}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chargeback</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warranty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 保留账户能力，再用诉讼时效保留主体关系记录，把&quot;能扣钱&quot;与&quot;能起诉&quot;分开。</li>\n<li>保留期必须是数据事实而非声明，并记录延长次数；反复延长的主体应作为再入驻的强风险信号（见 <a href=\"reactivation-readmission-rule\">关店复活/再入驻限制与退出度量</a>）。</li>\n<li>品牌授权解绑必须与商品状态变更一起发生，否则会出现&quot;授权已解除但商品仍在售&quot;的高风险悬空状态；资质撤销要在数据上区分 <code>VOLUNTARY</code>/<code>EXPIRED</code>/<code>REVOKED_FOR_BREACH</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>企业主体绑定不应被删除，只能标记失效</strong>：它承载历史归属这一事实，与业务关系存续无关。</li>\n<li>解绑的前置校验必须与执行写在同一条件更新中（存储层闸门），并固化 <code>gate_snapshot</code>；解绑记录只追加、幂等，反复解绑重绑本身是风控信号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"品牌、资质与账户解绑与责任保留期","id":"品牌-资质与账户解绑与责任保留期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"解绑的五个对象与三种性质","id":"解绑的五个对象与三种性质"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么解绑必须有顺序而不是并行","id":"为什么解绑必须有顺序而不是并行"},{"level":2,"text":"责任保留期的定义与计算","id":"责任保留期的定义与计算"},{"level":3,"text":"保留期由三个窗口的最大值决定","id":"保留期由三个窗口的最大值决定"},{"level":3,"text":"保留期的记录方式","id":"保留期的记录方式"},{"level":2,"text":"品牌授权与资质的解绑","id":"品牌授权与资质的解绑"},{"level":3,"text":"品牌授权的解绑需要品牌方参与","id":"品牌授权的解绑需要品牌方参与"},{"level":3,"text":"资质解绑与\"是否可复活\"的耦合","id":"资质解绑与-是否可复活-的耦合"},{"level":3,"text":"企业主体绑定的不可解绑性","id":"企业主体绑定的不可解绑性"},{"level":2,"text":"解绑的执行控制","id":"解绑的执行控制"},{"level":3,"text":"解绑动作的前置校验","id":"解绑动作的前置校验"},{"level":3,"text":"解绑的不可逆性与审计","id":"解绑的不可逆性与审计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商家数据导出、删除与法定留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/data-release-lifecycle/data-export-delete-retention"},"next":{"title":"关店复活、再入驻限制与退出度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-offboarding-store-closure/data-release-lifecycle/reactivation-readmission-rule"}}